{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Way of the Dragons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a challenging parkour adventure filled with tricks and traps to mess with your friends. When they breathe fire at you, don\u2019t forget to run or you\u2019ll be stunned for a while!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/FireGif.gif?t=1749325769\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stay Alert</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, your friends can grab and throw you off at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/GrabGif.gif?t=1749325769\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/AttackGif.gif?t=1749325769\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Patience is a Virtue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if the parkour feels tough, just have fun. After all, it\u2019s just a game.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/AxeGif.gif?t=1749325769\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Who Needs a Timer to Fly?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since you\u2019re playing as a baby dragon, don\u2019t try to fly before your stamina bar is full or you\u2019ll probably fall and have to grab onto whatever you can!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656190?t=1749325769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/e97851eedc2f12c473e197fcf694b5c5b024605a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749325769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/a7e927d1e7c22e1354a6a899063e832d1e789ee5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749325769","capsule_ima